msgid ""
"Kaidan, a simple and user-friendly Jabber/XMPP client for every device and "
"platform"
msgstr ""
"Kaidan, un simplic e comprensibil cliente de Jabber/XMPP por omni aparate e "
"platform"

#. (itstool) path: component/developer_name
