msgstr "Developatores e contributores de Kaidan"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: im.kaidan.kaidan.appdata.xml:10
msgid ""
"Kaidan is a simple, user-friendly Jabber/XMPP client providing a modern user-"
"interface using Kirigami and QtQuick. The back-end of Kaidan is entirely "
"written in C++ using the qxmpp XMPP client library and Qt 5."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: im.kaidan.kaidan.appdata.xml:11
msgid ""
"Kaidan is not finished yet, so don’t expect it working as well as a finished "
"client will do."
msgstr ""

